{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他还憋着气，却因想起曾被当作自己人而短暂高兴，随后又心酸地怀疑离开是否真的会更好。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、短暂欣喜、心酸、犹疑\",\n      \"missed\": \"小字里的具体处境：出去走走、聊点别的只是暂时避开沉重问题，那一刻确实轻松，但心里的事仍没有答案。顶部关于和弦、切分节奏和流动不安的描述也需要逐句读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他还在生气，却因为想起曾经被当作自己人而高兴了一会儿，紧接着又陷入心酸和对离开的怀疑。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"压抑、欣喜、失落、犹豫\",\n      \"missed\": \"下方小字里暂时转移注意力、真实轻松与内心问题未解决之间的区别不容易一眼抓到；多声絮语、调性不定、昂扬退潮等音乐描述也需要细读。下方密集的金色点线更容易被当作单纯的音乐动画。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他仍然没有完全消气，想起过去被接纳的时刻曾短暂开心，但很快又意识到旧日回不去，对离开后的生活也没有把握。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"憋闷、怀念、短暂温暖、心酸、失落\",\n      \"missed\": \"新增的66—79焦躁急切、80—91转柔和轻盈，以及故乡夏日麦浪、从前亲近而无需防备的联想，都集中在较小的文字里，不容易一眼抓到。温柔为什么让人心颤、为什么因为离眼前太远而难过，也需要逐句读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"两块大标题之间其实有很清楚的情绪递进：憋着气，想起曾被当作自己人而短暂高兴，随后心酸并怀疑离开是否更好，人物处境和核心感受能够串起来。主要问题是具体处境和音乐画面都被放在较小的长行文字里，尤其第三张又增加了多层音乐与回忆意象；下方抽象的点线动画也没有直接呈现人物处境。因此一眼能抓住情绪主线，却不容易同时把具体事件、情绪变化和画面联想完整串成一回事。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3b1d63e2-a703-4be0-8ab3-7200885dcaca", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T003822598182Z", "elapsed_seconds": 73.765, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:39:36.355978+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0afcd55d4932b5733d9dc81fd5e938051deef723d994fc03ffa9ca10e166d787", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T003822598182Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "4733ecc9517be743047fe5ca29cb7e6a7066f7d463d1083ac8e9dee09df7bf64"}}}
